WEBVTT

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.620
Saturday?

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:22.480
I ran into an old friend, and we 
decided to go somewhere together.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.640
But it doesn't look like I can 
make it back the same day.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.160
It's okay, Grandmother.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.910
I can stay home by myself, and 
besides, I have Chutaro here with me.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.320
I'm not worried about leaving you home alone,

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.430
but why don't you ask someone 
to spend the night with you?

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.820
Just in case something happens, I'd feel 
much better if someone was here with you.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.770
You're right.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.800
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:14.550
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.150
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.060
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:37.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:46.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:47.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.320
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.120
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:56.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:15.970
That guy had the nerve to show 
up at Ms. Yoshimi's wedding.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.320
I wish he would consider 
the time and place...

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:23.500
Wondering when those guys will attach 
us really is wearing me down.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:29.440
But I'm so glad I was able to see 
Ms. Yoshimi looking so happy.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.060
Nagisa!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.050
Good morning!

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:41.540
Will you come and spend the night 
at my house this coming Saturday?

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.000
I'll be glad to!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.480
What good timing.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.420
Lately, I hate to go home.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:50.710
Why?

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:55.380
My mid-term exams this time were the pits.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:58.720
Whenever I'm at home, they 
keep hounding me to study...

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.980
It's been so uncomfortable.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.820
It's truly "watari ni fuNA."

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.900
It's "watari ni fuNE" (timely opportunity).

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:07.570
It came out on the exam.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.040
Did it?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.250
Yes, it did.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.690
Did you forget?

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.670
Nagisa!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.950
Shouldn't you ask your parents 
about spending the night with me?

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:21.490
I will... Don't worry.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:25.500
But if I tell them that you're going to 
help me study, I'm sure it'll be okay.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.010
Really? Then don't forget to bring 
your school books and things, too.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:30.820
What are you saying?

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:34.340
Why would I go over to spend the 
night at a friend's place to study?

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:36.870
I'm just using it as an excuse.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.070
Nagisa...!

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:42.250
I'm going to stay over at Honoka's house!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.670
I wish Saturday would come quickly.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.480
"INVITATION TO A DREAM WORLD?! 
ONE-NIGHT JOURNEY INTO DARKNESS"

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.090
Shall we have tea?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.240
Coming zakenna!

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.300
Hurry zakenna!

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.420
All right zakenna!

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:16.940
What do you think you're doing zakenna?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.960
I'm sorry zakenna!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.200
Do you think you can get away with 
just saying you're sorry zakenna?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.700
I'm sorry zakenna!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.310
Like I said... do you think you can get 
away with just saying you're sorry zakenna?

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:26.120
Be quiet!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.240
Hurry, and clean it up.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.810
I'm sorry zakenna!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.110
Zakenna!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.430
It's hot! It's hot zakenna!

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:40.450
I'm sorry zakenna!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.420
Light and dark are two 
sides of the same coin.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:48.370
The power of light and the power of 
darkness have always been rivals,

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:51.130
opposing each other and 
fighting against each other...

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:54.900
Light and darkness have the same power.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.750
We can't take them lightly.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:01.700
That's right. Pretty Cure are the legendary 
warriors with strong powers of light.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:03.910
There's no way that you can win against them.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:09.150
So just forget about the 
power of the Prism Stones.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.830
The power of darkness will 
annihilate everything.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.860
We won't lose to the power of light.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.040
In order to make the power 
of darkness complete,

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.940
the power of the stones is essential.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.790
For the sake of Jyaku-King.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.570
That's not the only reason.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.670
The cleaning's done, the 
bedding is airing out,

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.050
I have sweets to go with our tea.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.600
Everything's ready.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.590
Coming!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.650
Welcome!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.300
Hello!

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.920
Sorry to intrude!

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:51.060
What are you all doing here?

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:53.260
I'm sorry to barge in all of a sudden,

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.530
but when we heard Nagisa was 
coming over to your house...

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.290
We came along with her.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.970
I've always wanted to 
come over to your place.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.050
It's okay, isn't it?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.530
You, too, Yuriko?

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:07.590
I happened to run into Misumi-san, 
and she invited me to come along.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.780
I thought, "The more the merrier."

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:12.220
Are you upset?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.520
Of course not! You're all welcome!

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.040
Make sure no one sees you.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.790
Stay here, and be quiet.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:21.690
All right mepo.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:22.850
All right mipo.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.170
All right popo.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:25.740
Mipple!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.690
Mepple!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.790
Popo!

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.950
Pollun! Go away mepo!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:35.860
Play with Pollun popo! Play with Pollun popo!

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.860
I guess it can't be helped mipo...

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:38.520
Mipple! Don't spoil him mepo!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.080
He's just going to take advantage mepo.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.220
But...

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:44.440
Popo!

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:45.680
Popo... popo...

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.240
Popo...?

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:50.790
Popo!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.640
You have a storehouse.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.160
It's the first time I've seen one.

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.000
It's just a small one.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.760
Living with just your grandmother in 
a big house like this... It's awesome!

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:05.230
The only trouble is trying to keep up 
with the housework once in a while.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.570
Popo... Popo... Popo!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.570
Popo!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.610
Wasn't there something 
riding on Chutaro's back?

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.240
Like a stuffed animal...

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.700
Really? Maybe you imagined it...

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.740
But... didn't you hear a strange voice?

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:22.680
It sounded like, "Popo..."

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.810
Lately, Chutaro cries, "Popo!"

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.670
A dog crying, "Popo"? That's really curious.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:33.100
Shall we all make dinner together tonight?

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:35.800
Sounds great. Let's have a party.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:38.520
A party? Sounds good to me.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.700
Sounds like fun.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.840
I'm all for it!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.270
It's expensive.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.240
Can't they make it a little cheaper?

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:51.050
It was picked fresh this 
morning, so it can't be helped.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.130
Still...

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:56.840
"Daikon" radishes should be 
fresh-looking, without wrinkles...

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:00.700
The brown outer layer of the round 
onions should be crisp and dry...

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.420
That way, they taste better.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.860
Is that right?

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:08.760
We'll have to get Nagisa, who hates 
round onions, to eat some, too.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.170
Where's Nagisa?

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.630
Where did she go?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.180
Nagisa! What are you doing?

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:21.550
I'm picking out some sweets.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:24.300
This new brand of chocolate 
is really delicious.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.740
And this is my favorite chocolate right now.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.720
She's just like the little children.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.880
What are you making?

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.030
Sweet-and-sour pork.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.050
Don't put any round onions in it.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:49.310
What's sweet-and-sour pork without onions?

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:51.870
You're going to eat lots 
of round onions today.

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:52.760
Okay.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.480
What are you making?

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.680
Cupcakes for dessert after dinner.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.710
Looks delicious! Do your best.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.450
What are you making?

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.530
Potato salad.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:02.940
I'm so happy.

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.600
What have you been doing, Nagisa?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.200
I'm giving you all my support.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:08.810
Never mind giving us support...

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.160
Why don't you give us a hand, Nagisa?

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:14.630
I'm not proud of it, but I have no 
confidence at all when it comes to cooking.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.100
Then why don't you practice today?

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:21.200
If you can't fix your own meals, 
you'll be in trouble in the future.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.540
But...

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:26.540
If you avoid doing things because you're not 
good at it, you won't be able to do anything.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:30.270
I'm done!

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.210
Why is it so small?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:36.490
The skin is thicker than the potato.

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:37.700
What a waste!

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.470
I told you I wasn't good at this...

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.470
No one is good at it from the beginning.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.250
It takes practice.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.690
Once more.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:51.660
Ouch!

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:54.450
I cut my finger!

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:55.960
Don't get excited.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.940
There you go!

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.640
Don't worry... The cut isn't deep, 
so it won't take long to heal.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:03.610
Thank you.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.130
They're just like mother 
and daughter, aren't they?

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:08.200
Cheers!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.350
Nagisa! You're eating too fast...

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.990
Why don't you slow down, and taste the food?

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.950
I am tasting it.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.360
Your boiled meat and potatoes 
are the best, Honoka.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.430
You should all try it.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.400
It really is delicious.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:24.850
It's awesome... Really awesome!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.380
I didn't know boiled meat and 
potatoes tasted this good.

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:29.170
It's delicious!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.910
My grandmother's a good 
cook, and she taught me...

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:38.250
You're smart, good at housework, 
and cute on top of that...

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.290
It's no wonder you're so 
popular with the boys...

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.950
Me?

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.430
You're really popular.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:47.070
They all want to confess their love 
for you, but they can't do it.

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:50.540
Isn't that what they call a mountain 
of treasure (takara no yama)?

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:54.130
Don't you mean "out of one's 
reach" (takane no hana)?

00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.530
Don't you have someone 
you love, Yukishiro-san?

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:04.010
Isn't there someone you're interested in?

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.950
Don't you have anyone?

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.120
You do, don't you?

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.270
No, I don't.

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.560
Really?

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.940
I really don't.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.150
Yuriko... This sweet-and-sour 
pork looks delicious.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.470
Doesn't it? I have confidence 
in my sweet-and-sour pork.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.830
You don't know anything about me...

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.150
You have no right to say that!

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.190
I can't escape from my own destiny...

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.340
No matter how hard I try!

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:11.480
Popo...

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:21.980
It's quiet after everyone left, isn't it?

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:25.500
Honoka?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.820
I'm sorry... What is it?

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:31.190
They should have all spent the night...

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:32.590
It can't be helped.

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:35.140
They can't spend the night 
at the last minute...

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.400
It's strange, isn't it?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:43.640
My spending the night at your house...

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:47.750
We were in the same class, but we 
hardly ever spoke to each other...

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:49.430
Until we became Pretty Cure.

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:55.220
That's true... Meeting Mipple and 
Mepple, and becoming Pretty Cure...

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.400
It hasn't even been a year,

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.080
but I feel as though I've always 
have been together with you.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:01.430
I feel the same way...

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:04.560
We were attacked so many times, and 
got into a lot of tight spots, too.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.830
The worst was that time...

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:08.860
When?

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:13.740
The two of us may be Pretty Cure, but other 
than that, we're not friends or anything!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.980
I'm sorry about what I said...

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.110
But I think because of that 
we became real friends.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:29.180
We went to the Field of Light, 
and to Dotsuku Zone, too.

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:34.180
We met lots of people... Queen and Senior...

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.180
We parted with people, too.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.370
Honoka...?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.480
Do you want to see Kiriya-kun?

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:55.620
I'm sorry if I asked something strange...

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.140
If you don't want to answer...

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.310
I don't know.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:03.000
If I could see him, I think I'd 
really want to see him, but...

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.210
I also feel that I don't 
want to see him again.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:10.570
What's going to happen to us from now on?

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.670
I'll be here.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.920
I'm not a very good student,

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:21.000
and I can't cook either, and 
I may not be too reliable,

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.730
but I'll always be by your side.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:26.340
Thank you.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:38.650
Popo!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.240
Popo... popo...

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:42.530
Popo...

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.340
Where am I?

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.560
Is this the Field of Light?

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.040
What is this?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.140
Why am I dressed like this?

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.540
Misumi-san!

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:12.070
Fuji-P?

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:13.430
I came for you.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.640
Why?

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.670
For a date, of course.

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:22.500
A date? You're kidding! It's like a dream.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.500
It is a dream.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.430
This is a dream.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.090
I see... That's right.

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:31.180
This couldn't be real, could it?

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:33.760
Let's go on our date.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:39.410
Fuji-P! Shouldn't you let me ride with you?

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.610
Nagisa!

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:42.110
Honoka!

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.460
Wait!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:48.140
Fuji-P! Wait!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.630
An experiment in the middle 
of the great outdoors.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.730
I've always wanted to do this.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:03.510
It exploded, but instead of 
smoke, it's flower petals?

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.850
Is this... a dream?

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:08.560
That's right. It's a dream!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.470
Wait!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.990
Nagisa?

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.860
Nagisa!

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.860
Honoka?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.470
Why are you here?

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:28.350
This is a dream, isn't it?

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:31.100
Are we having the same dream?

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.030
Are you enjoying yourselves?

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.890
Fuji-P!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.030
Fujimura-kun?

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.740
Where were you? I looked all over for you!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:40.990
I'm sorry!

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:43.850
Did you enjoy your nice dream?

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.430
Fujimura-kun?

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:50.510
Fuji-P?

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.250
It's time to get rid of you!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.350
Pretty Cure...?

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:56.860
You...!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:06.740
So, they ran away...

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.030
Transform, Honoka...

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:11.970
How? This is a dream.

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:13.530
Mepple and Mipple aren't here.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:19.460
Wake up popo!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.990
Both of you... wake up popo!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.470
This is terrible popo! This is terrible popo!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.540
Pretty Cula's in trouble popo!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:51.010
This is terrible popo!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.770
Light can't win in the darkness.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:11.310
Farewell, legendary warriors 
from the Field of Light!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.600
What?

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:19.480
That's...?

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:21.020
Mepple!

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.020
Mipple!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.000
That can't be!

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.890
Nagisa? Why are you dressed like that mepo?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:33.540
I thought we were sleeping 
in Honoka's room mipo.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.600
We'll explain later... We need to transform!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:43.220
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.490
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.230
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.010
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.370
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.680
Go back to where you came from!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.280
Do you think you can make me go back?

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:32.290
You're going back!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:36.620
How could you ruin my beautiful dream!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:37.810
You're going back!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.310
Dream?

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.510
Do you think that your wonderful 
future is as wonderful as this dream?

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.970
This is your future!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:54.440
The light will disappear, and the 
world will be wrapped in darkness.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:57.400
True darkness where there 
are no dreams or hopes!

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:01.830
Stop your fruitless struggling, and hand 
over the power of the Prism Stones!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.390
No, we won't hand it over!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.910
We won't hand it over to someone who 
will only use it for destruction!

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.190
How foolish!

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.200
This is the world of darkness...

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.630
This is my world!

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.660
Your power of light won't work here.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:35.970
White!

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:36.820
Black!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.790
Black Thunder!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.250
White Thunder!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.670
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:54.500
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.980
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.010
What is this power?

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.360
How can they produce power like this?

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.170
Come to think of it...

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.700
How did you two get here, Mepple and Mipple?

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.870
I have no idea how we got here mepo.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.630
Before we knew it, we were here mipo.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:42.210
It doesn't matter.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:51.630
I'm exhausted popo.

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:55.760
Popo...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.020
I'm home, Honoka.

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:09.470
Honoka!

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.570
All right! We have it made now.

00:23:55.570 --> 00:23:57.130
This is the game for the 
lacrosse championship.

00:23:57.130 --> 00:23:58.280
Good luck, Nagisa.

00:23:58.280 --> 00:23:59.040
Leave it to me!

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:01.110
I'll give you the championship 
as a present, Honoka.

00:24:01.110 --> 00:24:01.950
Where am I?

00:24:01.950 --> 00:24:03.040
Not you again?

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:04.420
No matter how many times 
you come, it's useless...

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:05.520
What's wrong?

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:07.430
He seems to be in pain.

00:24:07.430 --> 00:24:08.120
Is that...

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:09.960
the Power of Power of Annihilation?

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:15.330
"WE WON'T LOSE!! 
BLOW THE POWER OF DARKNESS AWAY!"

00:24:15.330 --> 00:24:17.950
If it's chocolate, I can eat it all up.

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:20.000
Chocolate again?
